/*
 * Explicit template solving for variadic template parameters.
 *
 * TemplateExplicitVariadicSolving handles template parameters of the form:
 *
 *     T...
 *
 * where the template variable `T` may bind to:
 *   - a single type, or
 *   - a list of types(variadic expansion).
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::template_::solve::explicit::variadic
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/template_/solve/explicit/variadic.yr
